 "result": "Based on my thorough analysis of the codebase, I have identified all the classes that belong to the Order Management domain. Let me compile the final list:\n\n**Domain Objects:**\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Order` - Core order entity\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.LineItem` - Individual line items within orders\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Sequence` - Unique ID generation for orders\n\n**Business Layer:**\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.service.OrderService` - Business logic for order operations\n\n**Presentation Layer:**\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.web.actions.OrderActionBean` - Web action handler for orders\n\n**Data Layer:**\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.OrderMapper` - Data access for orders\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.LineItemMapper` - Data access for line items\n- `org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.SequenceMapper` - Data access for sequence management\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Order Management\": [\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Order\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.LineItem\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Sequence\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.service.OrderService\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.web.actions.OrderActionBean\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.OrderMapper\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.LineItemMapper\",\n    \"org.mybatis.jpetstore.mapper.SequenceMapper\"\n  ]\n}\n```",
